{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13111370","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13111370","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1311137001:1":{"text":"루보미르, 조금 전 그 사람이 정말 공주님인가요? 그녀의 눈은... 마치 망령 같았어요! 너... 너무 무서워요!","source_cn":"柳博米尔，刚才那个真的是公主殿下吗？她的眼睛……她就像...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E69C78B9018CE1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311137002:1":{"text":"누가 되었든, 알레나는 아니에요.","source_cn":"不管那是谁，都不是亚莲娜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF144A3C126175906","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1311137002":{"text":"누가 되었든, 알레나는 아니에요.","source_cn":"不管那是谁，都不是亚莲娜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF144A3C126175906","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1311137003:1":{"text":"발리카...","source_cn":"瓦丽卡……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CBAA49E3B5C58D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311137004:1":{"text":"...아, 아니야, 난... 난 괜찮아...","source_cn":"……啊，不，我……我没事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE911455A3C201C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1311137005:1":{"text":"괜찮아 보이지 않아요...","source_cn":"你可不像没事的样子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x793337547B5277D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1311137006:1":{"text":"그녀... 우리... 우린 성으로 가야 해. 내 추측이 맞다면 모든 근원은 그곳에 있어...","source_cn":"她……我们……我们得去一趟城堡，如果我猜得没错，一切的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF372FBE8747BC5DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1311137007:1":{"text":"그곳은 아주 위험할 테니 너희는... 이곳에 남아 있도록 해.","source_cn":"那里可能会很危险，你们……留在这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x925816B20A90A1EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1311137008:1":{"text":"두렵지 않아요! 길을 떠날 때마다 위험하지 않았던 적이 없었던걸요!","source_cn":"我们才不怕呢！再说了，我们出门就没有不遇到危险的时候！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF32129C00C26196C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1311137009:1":{"text":"그렇다면... 이걸 가져가세요. 이건 바레샤 성 내부의 지도에요. 낡기는 했지만 도움이 될 겁니다.","source_cn":"既然如此……拿着吧，这是瓦勒沙城堡内部的地图，虽然有些...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C25D11D5B37CAF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:12::2":{"text":"얼음 성 지도 한 장","source